        "innocentReading": "The edge says only that an accused was extradited, got bail from the SC and the HC after more than six years of custody, and that charges were not yet framed after seven years. That reflects slow investigation and multi-agency (CBI/ED) proceedings, not a finding of guilt or innocence. Nothing in it implies wrongdoing by any government, and it is as consistent with prosecutorial delay as with a strong case.",
