        "denialFound": "The record already carries answers from the accused officers' side. AFT, 5 Sep 2014 (Deccan Chronicle): \"The petitioner, Lt. Gen. Rath (retd.) is acquitted of all charges. He is entitled to restoration of all benefits with 12 percent interest\". The tribunal also blamed the respondents for \"undue harassment and loss of reputation\" (https://www.deccanchronicle.com/140906/nation-current-affairs/article/lt-general-p-k-rathretd-cleared-sukna-scam). SC, 24 Jan 2019: the GCM was improperly constituted (one Lt Gen and four Maj Gens) and \"the entire proceedings held by the said GCM stood vitiated\" (https://www.legalservicesindia.com/law/print/1159). Rath also spoke publicly (deccanherald.com 'rath-says-he-has-been'). No separate response from the MoD on the rulings was found. We did not ask for one.",
