        "denialFound": "The respondent was Union of India (MoD/Army). Its position, as recorded in the order, was that Rule 40(2) of the Army Rules was complied with because the appellant had already retired, and the AFT had accepted this. The SC rejected it: \"Merely because the appellant had retired in the meantime cannot be a ground to discard and give a go by to the provisions of Rule 40(2)\". I found no later MoD statement or review petition. Not asked by us.",
