        "innocentReading": "Pensions and pay are deferred and current wages owed to about 14 lakh serving personnel and about 33 lakh military and civilian pensioners. The pension share rose after OROP (2015) and the 7th CPC (2016), both policy decisions about people. Defence budgets with large standing armies are personnel-heavy everywhere. Meanwhile capital outlay is still 28% of the demand (₹1.92 lakh crore) and growing in rupee terms.",
